    "Calzado cómodo, Abrigo para la tarde/noche, Protector solar, Anteojos de sol, Gorra, Botella personal": "Comfortable shoes, a warm layer for the afternoon and evening, sunscreen, sunglasses, a cap and your own water bottle.",
    "Campera rompeviento e impermeable, Piloto de lluvia, Remeras de manga corta de poliester, Buzo o campera polar, Pantalón comodo para caminar (secado rápido), Cuatro pares de medias sintéticas, Botas o zapatillas de trekking, Gorro para sol, Buff, Gorro abrigado, Mochila de marcha 40lts, Bolsa de dormir abrigada, Elementos de higiene personal, Anteojos de sol, Recipiente para llevar 2lts de agua, Protector solar, Linterna de cabeza, Zapatillas de descanso, Bolso o mochila grande (para cargueros) y Ojotas o crocs.": "A windproof and waterproof jacket, a rain poncho, short-sleeved polyester shirts, a fleece jumper or jacket, comfortable quick-dry walking trousers, four pairs of synthetic socks, hiking boots or shoes, a sun hat, a buff, a warm hat, a 40-litre trekking backpack, a warm sleeping bag, personal toiletries, sunglasses, a container for 2 litres of water, sunscreen, a head torch, shoes for resting, a large bag or backpack (for the pack animals) and flip-flops or crocs.",
    "Gorra, Gafas de sol, Buff, Gorro de lana, Guantes primera piel, 2 a 3 remeras para trekking, remera manga larga para descanso, Campera de pluma o acorde, Rompeviento, 2 buzos segunda piel (micropolar), Pantalón largo secado rápido, Pantalón abrigado para descanso, Calza térmica o primera piel, Short de trekking, 4 a 5 pares de medias, Botas o zapatillas de trekking, crocs o calzado para descanso": "A cap, sunglasses, a buff, a wool hat, base-layer gloves, 2-3 hiking shirts, a long-sleeved shirt for resting, a down jacket or similar, a windbreaker, 2 mid-layer fleeces, quick-dry long trousers, warm trousers for resting, thermal leggings or a base layer, hiking shorts, 4-5 pairs of socks, hiking boots or shoes, and crocs or shoes for resting."
